*** Claude found bug: up-transformation-without-input-views

set show timing off .
set show advisories off .

*** A transformation with no input views: upImports writes its fourth argument as a _,_
*** with no arguments, printed "_, _".
*** Expected for A: 'TUPLE[empty]('2)[empty]{'Nat, 'Nat} (at the kind all the same, its
*** second argument empty not being a ModuleExpression in META-LEVEL).
*** Expected for B: the sort ImportList and 'LIST{'@['NAT]('NzNat)[empty]}; here the
*** broken node is the only thing that leaves the result at the kind.

fmod A is
  protecting TUPLE(2){Nat, Nat} .
endfm

fmod B is
  protecting LIST{@[NAT](NzNat)} .
endfm

red in META-LEVEL : upImports('A) .

red in META-LEVEL : upImports('B) .
